  "content": "[Intro]\n[Db]\n[Db]  [Ab/Db]\n[Db7]  [Gb/Db]\n[A]  [Gbm7]\n[Db/F]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Bbm]Just look at all those hungry\n[Ab]mouths we have to [Gbmaj7]feed.\n[Bbm]Take a look at all the\n[Ab]suffering we [Ebm7]breed.\n[Dbsus4/Ab]So many [Db/Ab]lonely faces\n[Absus4/Eb]scattered all around [Ebm]\n[F]Searching for what they [Gbmaj7]need.\n[Ebm7]Is this the\n\n[Chorus]\n[Db]world we [Ab/Db]created? What\ndid we do it for? [Gb/Db]Is this the\n[Bbm]world we invated\n[Fm]Against the [Ab]law? So it\n[Db]seems in the end. [Ab/Db]Is\n[Db7]this what we're all [Gb/Db]living for to-\n[A]day? The [Gbm7]world that we cre-\n[Db/F]a ted.\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Bbm]You know that everyday a\n[Ab]helpless child [Gbmaj7]in born.\n[Bbm]Who needs some loving care in-\n[Ab]side a happy [Ebm7]home.\n[Dbsus4/Ab]Somewhere a [Db/Ab]wealthy man is\n[Absus4/Eb]sitting on his throne [Ebm]\n[F]Waiting for life to go [Gbmaj7]by.\nOhh\n[Ebm7]Is this the\n\n[Chorus]\n[Db]world we [Ab/Db]created? We\nmade it on our own. [Gb/Db]Is this the\n[Bbm]world we devastated\n[Fm]Right to [Ab]the bone? If there's a God\n[Db]in the sky [Ab/Db]looking\n[Db7]down, What can he [Gb/Db]think of what we've\n[A]done To the [Gbm7]world that He cre-\n[Db/F]a ted?",
